CH4 + H <=> CH3 + H2           2.200E+04    3.000    4406
C2H5 + H <=> 2CH3              1.000E+14    0.000    13350
2CH3 <=> C2H6                  9.030E+16    -1.180   330
C2H4 + H <=> C2H5              2.210E+13    0.000    1040
C2H4 <=> C2H2 + H2             1.500E+15    0.000    41467
H3SICH3 <=> SIH2 + CH4         2.000E+14    0.000    36413
H3SICH3 <=> HSICH3 + H2        1.000E+14    0.000    32033
SI2 <=> 2SI_G                  1.000E+15    0.000    37460
SI2 + CH4 <=> SI2C + 2H2       3.011E+15    0.000    10000
